{"path":"string/basic_string/front","title":"std::basic_string<CharT,Traits,Allocator>::front","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_string&lt;CharT,Traits,Allocator&gt;::</span>front","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/basic_string/front","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Returns reference to the first character in the string. The behavior is undefined if empty() is true.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">CharT<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> front<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(constexpr since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> CharT<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> front<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(constexpr since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns reference to the first character in the string. The behavior is undefined if <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string/empty\">empty()</a></span> is <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Reference to the first character, equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">operator<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>In libstdc++, <code>front()</code> is <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://gcc.gnu.org/onlinedocs/libstdc++/manual/strings.html#strings.string.shrink\" data-external=\"1\">not available</a> in C++98 mode.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> s<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Exemplary\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> f1 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> s.<span class=\"me1\">front</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    f1 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">'e'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// \"exemplary\"</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> c<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Exemplary\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">char</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> f2 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> c.<span class=\"me1\">front</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>f2 <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// \"Exemplary\"</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>exemplary\nExemplary</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue534\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 534</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\">std::basic_string</a></span> did not have the member function <code>front()</code>\n</td>\n<td>added\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string/back\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>back</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark\">(<span>DR*</span>)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  accesses the last character <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view/front\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>front</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  accesses the first character <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_string_view&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"string","title":"Strings library"},{"path":"string/basic_string","title":"std::basic_string"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_string<CharT,Traits,Allocator>::front","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Returns reference to the first character in the string. The behavior is undefined if empty() is true."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Reference to the first character, equivalent to operator[](0)."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Notes","note":"In libstdc++, front() is not available in C++98 mode."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"back","note":"accesses the last character"},{"label":"front","note":"accesses the first character"}]}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":153,"codeBlockCount":2}
